1 0 0 1 50 758 Tm /F2 12 Tf ([SECTION: PIB Cabinet Decision] CABINET APPROVES EXTENSION OF PM-KISAN SCHEME TO ALL FARMER FAMILIES) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 740 Tm /F1 10 Tf ([PARA | SEC=PIB Para 1] New Delhi, 31st May 2019. The Union Cabinet, chaired by Prime Minister Narendra Modi, has approved the extension of the Pradhan Mantri Kisan Samman Nidhi \(PM-KISAN\) to all eligible farmer families in the country, irrespective of the size of their landholdings. This decision removes the 2 hectare ceiling, bringing an estimated 14.5 crore farmers under the scheme with effect from 1st April 2019.) Tj
